l_url":"https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/issues/4601#issuecomment-355368146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syncthing/syncthing/issues/4601","id":355368146,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1NTM2ODE0Ng==","user":{"login":"AudriusButkevicius","id":1144861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDQ4NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1144861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius","html_url":"https://github.com/AudriusButkevicius","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-01-04T18:59:37Z","updated_at":"2018-01-04T18:59:37Z","body":"```\r\npackage main\r\n\r\nimport(\r\n\t\"fmt\"\r\n\t\"github.com/sasha-s/go-deadlock\"\r\n\t\"math/rand\"\r\n\t\"time\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nfunc callRandom(i int,  x *Thing) {\r\n\tfor {\r\n\t\tr := rand.Intn(4)\r\n\t\tif r == 0 {\r\n\t\t\tx.DoOne(i)\r\n\t\t} else if r == 1 {\r\n\t\t\tx.DoTwo(i)\r\n\t\t} else if r == 2 {\r\n\t\t\tx.DoThree(i)\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc main(){\r\n\tfmt.Println(\"Hello World\")\r\n\tx := &Thing{\r\n\t\tcounter: &Counter{},\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tfor i := 0; i < 10; i++ {\r\n\t\tgo callRandom(i, x)\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\ttime.Sleep(10*time.Second)\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\ntype Counter struct {\r\n  mut deadlock.Mutex\r\n  count int\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc (c *Counter) Inc() {\r\n\tc.mut.Lock()\r\n\tc.count++\r\n\tc.mut.Unlock()\r\n}\r\n\r\ntype Thing struct {\r\n    mut deadlock.Mutex\r\n\tcounter *Counter\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc (t *Thing) DoOne(i int) {\r\n\tfmt.Println(i, \"one\")\r\n\tt.mut.Lock()\r\n\tt.counter.Inc()\r\n\tt.mut.Unlock()\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc (t *Thing) DoTwo(i int) {\r\n\tfmt.Println(i, \"two\")\r\n\tt.counter.Inc()\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc (t *Thing) DoThree(i int) {\r\n\tfmt.Println(i, \"three\")\r\n\tt.mut.Lock()\r\n\tt.mut.Unlock()\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo this doesn't repro it, so I suspect we do have some problems.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syncthing/syncthing/issues/comments/355368146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"AudriusButkevicius","id":1144861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDQ4NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1144861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius","html_url":"https://github.com/AudriusButkevicius","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AudriusButkevicius/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syncthing/sy